Fine, it's settled!

265
00:15:25,516 --> 00:15:29,887
First, we go straight down from the top, 1,000 meters nonstop.

266
00:15:30,087 --> 00:15:31,722
-You're nuts! -Don't call me nuts!

267
00:15:33,524 --> 00:15:36,694
Show some respect to your coach! Cool your head!

268
00:15:38,562 --> 00:15:40,597
I don't recognize you as my coach!

269
00:15:40,798 --> 00:15:41,965
Just shut up and move it!

270
00:15:42,232 --> 00:15:42,933
Where?

271
00:15:43,233 --> 00:15:44,301
Hurry up!

272
00:15:44,535 --> 00:15:46,403
Will Father be okay?

273
00:15:46,603 --> 00:15:50,274
Don't worry. Ryo-chan may not look it, but he's really caring.

274
00:15:51,075 --> 00:15:52,776
You can't ride the lift?!

275
00:15:53,177 --> 00:15:55,846
I'm not good with heights.

276
00:15:56,447 --> 00:15:59,316
This is my chance to get revenge for my betting ticket!

277
00:15:59,783 --> 00:16:03,320
-You can't ski if you don't ride the lift! -Let go! Stop it!

278
00:16:03,554 --> 00:16:05,656
Cut it out! Let me down!

279
00:16:05,856 --> 00:16:07,257
Let go, you idiot!

280
00:16:11,595 --> 00:16:12,930
You jerk!

281
00:16:13,397 --> 00:16:14,198
Don't swing it!

282
00:16:14,431 --> 00:16:15,733
Shut up! I'm sitting here!

283
00:16:15,933 --> 00:16:18,302
Don't come up here! We can't both sit here!

284
00:16:18,502 --> 00:16:19,803
Then you get off!

285
00:16:20,404 --> 00:16:21,305
Owww...

286
00:16:25,876 --> 00:16:27,478
You idiot!

287
00:16:30,581 --> 00:16:32,950
Ahhh! Too high! Too scary!

288
00:16:33,150 --> 00:16:35,652
-I can't breathe! Grab my hands! -Help me!

289
00:16:41,625 --> 00:16:43,360
Are we starting here?

290
00:16:43,594 --> 00:16:44,294
That's right.

291
00:16:44,495 --> 00:16:46,196
It's almost vertical!

292
00:16:46,430 --> 00:16:49,033
Perfect for straight-down practice!

293
00:16:49,233 --> 00:16:51,969
But I don't even know how to turn or stop yet!

294
00:16:52,169 --> 00:16:53,504
I'll teach you on the way down.

295
00:16:53,704 --> 00:16:54,805
No way!

296
00:16:55,372 --> 00:16:57,708
This time, I'll really get my revenge.

297
00:16:57,908 --> 00:16:58,909
Go already!

298
00:17:05,082 --> 00:17:06,917
All right. You're doing great!

299
00:17:07,151 --> 00:17:08,385
Now try a diagonal run!

300
00:17:08,986 --> 00:17:11,922
Like this, then this, see? Just like that!

301
00:17:21,098 --> 00:17:22,032
Hop.

302
00:17:22,366 --> 00:17:23,534
Heave-ho!

303
00:17:26,503 --> 00:17:28,906
Jeez. What a troublesome old man.

304
00:17:29,239 --> 00:17:29,873
What's wrong?

305
00:17:30,073 --> 00:17:31,809
My stomach's cold in the snow.

306
00:17:32,009 --> 00:17:35,279
What a pathetic martial artist. Go take care of it behind a tree.

307
00:17:35,746 --> 00:17:36,814
Fine.

308
00:17:39,483 --> 00:17:41,285
Never thought I'd do this abroad...

309
00:17:41,952 --> 00:17:43,554
Huh? Brrr...

310
00:17:43,821 --> 00:17:45,022
I'm getting cold too.

311
00:17:49,927 --> 00:17:50,761
Huh...

312
00:17:51,495 --> 00:17:53,130
Ah, ahhh!

313
00:17:53,363 --> 00:17:54,498
Hey, stop it!

314
00:17:54,765 --> 00:17:57,234
What? N-No! Don't come this way!

315
00:17:57,534 --> 00:17:58,735
Don't grab me!

316
00:17:58,936 --> 00:18:00,204
Stop me!

317
00:18:00,737 --> 00:18:02,406
Your skis are on mine and I can't stop!

318
00:18:03,107 --> 00:18:07,244
Idiot! Get your hands off my pants! They're sliding down!

319
00:18:07,744 --> 00:18:10,247
We're going faster!

320
00:18:18,055 --> 00:18:19,990
Hey, cut it out! This is humiliating!

321
00:18:44,815 --> 00:18:47,751
No matter where he goes, it always ends like this.

322
00:18:52,156 --> 00:18:54,491
I just got a call from the Japanese consulate.

323
00:18:54,725 --> 00:18:56,994
Your passports will be ready the day after tomorrow.

324
00:18:57,194 --> 00:18:59,129
That's earlier than expected.

325
00:18:59,329 --> 00:19:02,999
So, do you want me to book a flight back to Japan?

326
00:19:03,567 --> 00:19:05,769
I kinda wanna stay longer,

327
00:19:05,969 --> 00:19:09,573
but I did sneak off. The chief 's probably furious.

328
00:19:09,973 --> 00:19:11,008
Huh?

329
00:19:11,208 --> 00:19:13,177
Lots of hunters around today.

330
00:19:13,610 --> 00:19:15,846
It's a local hunting club's meeting.

331
00:19:16,046 --> 00:19:18,115
This area has a lot of bear attacks.

332
00:19:18,315 --> 00:19:19,683
I see.

333
00:19:19,983 --> 00:19:21,385
By the way, Reiko-dono,

334
00:19:21,618 --> 00:19:24,955
thank you for arranging our Hondara Fist branch.

335
00:19:25,389 --> 00:19:27,457
Oh no, it's no big deal.

336
00:19:28,392 --> 00:19:29,393
Is it decided?

337
00:19:29,626 --> 00:19:33,497
I got permission to open a dojo in this hotel's training room.

338
00:19:33,697 --> 00:19:37,234
That's good. Now we can go back to Japan in peace.

339
00:19:37,467 --> 00:19:39,469
-Ai and you will stay here. -What?

340
00:19:39,670 --> 00:19:42,172
You two will be the branch managers.

341
00:19:42,372 --> 00:19:43,206
Ehhh?!

342
00:19:43,607 --> 00:19:46,677
Ai, just like you wish, you get to live here together.

343
00:19:46,877 --> 00:19:50,981
But Father, you never told me I'd be a branch manager.

344
00:19:51,181 --> 00:19:53,650
You'll be together. Isn't that enough?

345
00:19:53,850 --> 00:19:55,419
Maybe, but still...

346
00:19:55,986 --> 00:19:59,957
Don't be ridiculous! Why am I a branch manager?!

347
00:20:01,491 --> 00:20:03,327
Yes or no?

348
00:20:03,527 --> 00:20:04,728
No!

349
00:20:05,162 --> 00:20:05,896
Yes or no?

350
00:20:06,096 --> 00:20:06,897
No!

351
00:20:07,231 --> 00:20:08,098
Yes or no?

352
00:20:08,332 --> 00:20:09,166
No!

353
00:20:09,399 --> 00:20:10,067
Yes or no?

354
00:20:10,267 --> 00:20:11,335
No!

355
00:20:11,969 --> 00:20:13,070
Yes or no?

356
00:20:14,271 --> 00:20:16,373
Yes. Y-Yes...

357
00:20:16,573 --> 00:20:17,241
Good.

358
00:20:18,275 --> 00:20:20,644
Reiko-dono, would you like some tea in the tearoom?

359
00:20:20,877 --> 00:20:21,545
Sure.

360
00:20:23,447 --> 00:20:26,016
Ryo-sama, are you okay?

361
00:20:26,216 --> 00:20:27,818
He was weak when skiing, though.

362
00:20:28,352 --> 00:20:30,420
Maria, tell me his weakness.

363
00:20:30,654 --> 00:20:31,288
What?

364
00:20:31,521 --> 00:20:34,391
As the branch managers of that embarrassing Kempo,

365
00:20:34,591 --> 00:20:37,294
we'll be stuck in Canada forever!

366
00:20:37,527 --> 00:20:38,729
B-But...

367
00:20:38,929 --> 00:20:41,832
Maria, you were tricked too, right?

368
00:20:42,032 --> 00:20:43,767
So tell me, Maria!

369
00:20:44,434 --> 00:20:47,537
All right. If you insist, Ryo-sama...

370
00:20:48,872 --> 00:20:51,475
When my father was training in the mountains,

371
00:20:51,708 --> 00:20:54,578
a bear bit him on the head from behind.

372
00:20:54,778 --> 00:20:57,547
Since then, he's terrified of bears.

373
00:20:57,881 --> 00:21:00,450
That's it! If he gets bitten again,

374
00:21:00,684 --> 00:21:04,021
he'll never mention the Canada branch again!

375
00:21:06,323 --> 00:21:08,058
This will work.

376
00:21:11,128 --> 00:21:14,598
Sew it tight. It can't fall off halfway.

377
00:21:14,798 --> 00:21:15,565
Sure.

378
00:21:15,966 --> 00:21:18,035
Guess it looks real 'cause it's a real bear.

379
00:21:26,276 --> 00:21:28,779
I'll hide here, so go get him.

380
00:21:28,979 --> 00:21:29,813
All right.

381
00:21:31,915 --> 00:21:33,950
I'll bite him with all my might.

382
00:21:34,985 --> 00:21:36,820
Huh? He's coming!

383
00:21:41,658 --> 00:21:43,160
-Oh my God! -Watch out!

384
00:21:43,827 --> 00:21:44,728
Get out!

385
00:21:49,766 --> 00:21:52,069
Oh, the hunters were gathering. Damn!

386
00:21:52,269 --> 00:21:55,639
Lately, the bears hang around us too often,

387
00:21:55,839 --> 00:21:57,641
and they scare me a lot.

388
00:21:57,841 --> 00:21:59,976
I've lost my sleep for days!

389
00:22:00,177 --> 00:22:02,179
All right! Yeah!

390
00:22:05,515 --> 00:22:07,284
Wow!

391
00:22:16,359 --> 00:22:18,495
It's sewn tight and I can't get it off!

392
00:22:19,029 --> 00:22:20,630
Wait! Listen to me!

393
00:22:23,934 --> 00:22:24,768
No!

394
00:22:25,402 --> 00:22:26,303
Here's my chance!

395
00:22:26,503 --> 00:22:27,804
He jumped down there!

396
00:22:35,412 --> 00:22:37,381
-Is that bear Ryo-chan? -Right.

397
00:22:37,581 --> 00:22:39,483
He tried to set me up, huh?

398
00:22:39,683 --> 00:22:41,318
Got it. I'll get him right away.

399
00:22:51,795 --> 00:22:54,264
-I'm gaining. -I'm get him!

400
00:22:58,335 --> 00:22:59,836
No! Don't shoot!

401
00:23:00,036 --> 00:23:01,972
I'm a human!

402
00:23:09,045 --> 00:23:12,249
Don't shoot! I'm Japanese police!

403
00:23:13,583 --> 00:23:15,252
Aaah! Gotta run to the mountains!

404
00:23:20,424 --> 00:23:21,525
Here I go!

405
00:23:41,077 --> 00:23:45,115
We caught all the bears alive, but I can't tell which one's Ryo-chan.

406
00:23:47,050 --> 00:23:48,752
I'm the real one! Damn it!

407
00:23:48,952 --> 00:23:51,288
I screamed so much, I lost my voice!

408
00:23:51,788 --> 00:23:53,790
These bears are good actors.

409
00:23:54,024 --> 00:23:55,459
I can't tell either.

410
00:23:55,659 --> 00:23:59,863
Damn you, Hondara jerk! You'll pay for this!

411
00:24:02,866 --> 00:24:08,672
YUM! A RECIPE FOR REVENGE
